    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Terrain Sculpting\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise hills, carve valleys, and sculpt flowing rivers and waterfalls. Sculpt landscapes where birds perch, butterflies flutter, and fish swim through winding streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716010/extras/a235b0de6d99e05ddf3885d33c303bae.poster.avif?t=1746479201\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716010/extras/a235b0de6d99e05ddf3885d33c303bae.webm?t=1746479201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716010/extras/a235b0de6d99e05ddf3885d33c303bae.mp4?t=1746479201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0f Dynamic World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a full day/night cycle with gentle rain, rustling wind, and shifting sunlight. Wildlife and weather bring each moment to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716010/extras/90c1c1fa643485ef13af063ed73a79fa.poster.avif?t=1746479201\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716010/extras/90c1c1fa643485ef13af063ed73a79fa.webm?t=1746479201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716010/extras/90c1c1fa643485ef13af063ed73a79fa.mp4?t=1746479201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf32 Bioluminescent Forests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, your woodland transforms into a glowing spectacle. Fireflies dance through the trees, and you're treated to a magical bioluminescent lightshow that brings the forest to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udeb7 Cosy Creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place trees, flowers, rocks, and more in a world that grows and responds with natural charm. Every addition feels like it belongs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26c5 Soothing Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calming, no-pressure space to unwind. There are no wrong choices or failure states\u2014only peaceful immersion in nature. You can always change your mind and reshape the world as inspiration strikes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Immersive Soundscape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax to ambient music woven with the gentle sounds of the forest\u2014chirping birds, flowing water, rustling leaves, and the soft hush of rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination bloom in Spellbound Shire, a meditative escape where the landscape lives and breathes with every gentle touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Terrain Sculpting\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise hills, carve valleys, and sculpt flowing rivers and waterfalls. Sculpt landscapes where birds perch, butterflies flutter, and fish swim through winding streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716010/extras/a235b0de6d99e05ddf3885d33c303bae.poster.avif?t=1746479201\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716010/extras/a235b0de6d99e05ddf3885d33c303bae.webm?t=1746479201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716010/extras/a235b0de6d99e05ddf3885d33c303bae.mp4?t=1746479201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0f Dynamic World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a full day/night cycle with gentle rain, rustling wind, and shifting sunlight. Wildlife and weather bring each moment to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716010/extras/90c1c1fa643485ef13af063ed73a79fa.poster.avif?t=1746479201\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716010/extras/90c1c1fa643485ef13af063ed73a79fa.webm?t=1746479201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716010/extras/90c1c1fa643485ef13af063ed73a79fa.mp4?t=1746479201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf32 Bioluminescent Forests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, your woodland transforms into a glowing spectacle. Fireflies dance through the trees, and you're treated to a magical bioluminescent lightshow that brings the forest to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udeb7 Cosy Creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place trees, flowers, rocks, and more in a world that grows and responds with natural charm. Every addition feels like it belongs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26c5 Soothing Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calming, no-pressure space to unwind. There are no wrong choices or failure states\u2014only peaceful immersion in nature. You can always change your mind and reshape the world as inspiration strikes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Immersive Soundscape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax to ambient music woven with the gentle sounds of the forest\u2014chirping birds, flowing water, rustling leaves, and the soft hush of rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination bloom in Spellbound Shire, a meditative escape where the landscape lives and breathes with every gentle touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A cozy, relaxing landscaping game where nature is your canvas. Shape the land, guide the water, and grow your own enchanted wilderness in Spellbound Shire, a no-stress, meditative experience inspired by Studio Ghibli, Zelda, and the Ori franchise.",
